WEBVTT

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.960
The religious state of Sarabael.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.720
All of it citizens are
adherents of the same faith,

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.370
resulting in a nation united by belief.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:20.830
Good afternoon. It's nice to meet you.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:22.370
We're gods!

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:25.460
Don't be ridiculous! Do you realize
who you're talking to?!

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:29.840
I am the one true holy arbiter of the
Divine Prontea who once blessed this land!

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:34.050
I am the Third Holy Pontiff
of Sarabael, Sagishi Sakushu!

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.630
"The Divine Prontea"?

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:39.390
Well, let's just say this
country has its own backstory.

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:44.560
Okay then. Stick to the plan,
all right, Paula?

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:45.900
Right.

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:52.060
How's that?! Behold the righteous wrath
of God's divine punishment!

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:56.130
Another unclean soul has
been delivered unto salv...

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:05.640
Is this good enough? But I can't
fly with them or anything.

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:07.200
They're just for decoration.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.490
That should suffice.

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:10.960
So, what now?

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:12.800
Just make something up.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.400
That isn't very helpful...

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:19.730
Uh, I came here today to talk with you all.

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:23.560
What are you all doing?!
Don't let her tricks fool you!

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:26.610
Those wings are fake! It's just a costume!

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:29.000
T-Technically, yes...

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:31.940
Taste the lord's might!

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:40.400
This is gonna be rough.
They aren't listening at all—

00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:42.850
Huh?

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:46.210
I-I had no idea you were truly a god!
Forgive my rudeness!

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:27.220
Now that everyone's gathered around,
I'd like to begin the discussion.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:30.430
These brats are supposed to be gods?!

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:34.480
If you want to make claims like that,
let's see some damn evidence!

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.590
Evidence, eh?

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:38.030
I can't say we have any of that.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:42.980
All we can really do is demonstrate power
and speed that prove we're not human...

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:45.240
There's also the fact that
firearms don't work on us.

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:52.540
We <i>are</i> the same beings as your Divine Prontea,
however, so you can consider us gods.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.660
Hey, can I ask something?

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:58.050
What exactly is the connection between
Prontea-san and this country?

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:01.050
You're a god, but you don't know that?

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:04.320
I'm afraid this particular god hasn't
been around for very long yet.

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:07.050
Why don't you explain for her, Mr. Pontiff?

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:07.810
O-Of course...

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:13.810
The land of Sarabael is said to predate
a supposed collapse of human civilization.

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:16.650
It's the oldest true holy land
in the world that's still intact.

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:20.070
Our history states that
it was founded by God.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:23.650
This country was actually
founded by Rin and the old guard

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:26.530
before the demons were sealed away.

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:29.970
Although it was originally
just an underground shelter

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:33.020
they dug up to keep the humans safe in...

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:38.650
However, for centuries,
few chose to stay in this land.

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:42.700
Landslides, drought,
flooding any time there was rain...

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:45.340
It was a very harsh place to survive.

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:48.600
Then God appeared to us...

00:04:49.090 --> 00:04:51.810
Over the course of days,
he changed the landscape itself,

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:53.200
tamed the floods,

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:58.260
and transformed this land
into something far more habitable.

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:02.610
Before he returned to the celestial
realm, he spake thus...

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:05.740
You can consider this place
sacred if you want,

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:09.730
but don't let that stop
you from improving on it!

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:12.980
Develop it in whatever way makes
it easier to live in, okay?

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:14.500
See ya around!

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.850
Yeah, okay, I get it now.

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:20.750
In other words, he was fixing up
Rin-san's sloppy construction...

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:23.690
And now, a hundred years later,

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:28.760
we are faithfully carrying out the command
passed down by the Divine Prontea.

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:34.270
But he didn't mention anything about
purging or "saving" other countries.

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:39.810
N-Now then, what can we help
you almighty gods with?

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:43.490
Was I speaking out of place to
declare myself your servant?

00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:46.100
You're right. Let's get to business.

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:49.390
In the near future, the gods,
including your Divine Prontea,

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:51.370
will destroy the Zoble Empire.

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:52.260
What?!

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:53.700
The Zoble Empire?!

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:55.970
It will be appear to be a military coup d'état

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:58.740
that results in a regime change.

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:03.340
And it will leave Sarabael and Hotaena
as the world's remaining superpowers.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:08.220
Now, to prevent global chaos,
we're prohibiting war between you two.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:13.940
After the coup, both Sarabael and Hotaena
will support their efforts to rebuild,

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.480
resulting in a tight-knit peace
between all three nations.

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:17.650
With Hotaena?

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:21.180
You expect us to work alongside
a country full of apostates?

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:22.190
What're you yammering about?

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:26.440
This country has been doing whatever
it wants in the name of god.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:28.190
The only "god" you care about

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:31.600
is the symbol that you
use unite your citizens.

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:35.670
And you use the authority that
affords you to enrich yourselves.

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:40.360
I honestly think that's great!

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:42.700
I mean, what did the first pontiff,

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:45.670
who earnestly worshiped god
and spent all his time praying, accomplish?

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:49.430
Your people were hungry and unprepared
to deal with pandemics and natural disasters,

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.180
leading to nothing but decline.

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:54.880
But since you've taken over,
religion has become a business.

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:56.490
And by using your faithful as slave labor,

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:58.680
you've turned this country
into a major player.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:01.160
In the eyes of human society,
that might make you scum.

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:04.690
But as far as us gods care?
We really don't.

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:09.450
Our only concerns are about excessive
environmental damage and large-scale war.

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:13.250
We don't want you <i>all</i> dying. That's all.

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:17.820
I don't really get the specifics
about all this human stuff,

00:07:17.820 --> 00:07:21.500
but try to get along with
Hotaena from now on, okay?

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:25.650
What should we do, Your Holiness?

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:29.010
We'll do as the gods have
decreed and avoid war.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:31.810
However, everything else
will be business as usual.

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:34.970
We'll continue to sell sham relics
according to improvised revelations,

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:38.970
keep sending psychics and entertainers
to other countries to proselytize,

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:41.810
increase our sway in the political
sphere of other nations,

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:46.660
continue gathering wealth, running
the country, and protecting our citizens.

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:50.720
It is the will of the gods!

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:58.330
"The bodies of Idaten, including their
clothing, constitute a single unit."

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:01.750
"Anything detached from the
main body will vanish over time,"

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:05.860
"so it is impossible to retrieve a sample."

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:09.250
How did you come to these conclusions?

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:14.940
Right here. The blood that was on Gyudo's
nose vanishes without a trace later on.

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:17.470
And Four-Eyes' glasses
also magically get fixed.

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:20.620
I'd say the bodies of Idaten are
less "matter" as we understand it,

00:08:20.620 --> 00:08:24.190
and more so a kind of "existence."

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:27.380
It's all in the report for you to peruse,

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:30.550
so is it okay if I focus
on the footage for now?

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:35.390
It's impressive you were able to figure
out all this from so little video.

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:41.060
This could be the key
to finding a weakness in the Idaten.

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:43.100
Someone's thinking positively.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:47.590
To be honest, we're way past the point
I think that's likely to happen...

00:08:55.390 --> 00:08:57.140
Hang in there, everyone!

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:59.180
Remember, the state will
take care of your children,

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:01.500
ensuring they turn into the
same kind of soldiers

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.890
who got you here in the first place!

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:05.050
You don't have to worry
about parenting at all!

00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:06.970
Relax and give birth without a care!

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:11.750
Looks like the girl over there just finished.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:14.400
Make sure to patch up the tears.

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.620
Otherwise it could be a
problem with the next batch.

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:17.670
Okay!

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.600
Oh, what's up, Miku?

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:24.710
Oh, I just needed to talk to Umeyo!

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:27.540
It's kind of a hard subject
to broach, but...

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:28.960
You preggers?

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:31.460
No, ma'am.

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:33.760
You long-haired—

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:46.320
He's already able to push me back?

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:49.260
How is he this much stronger after one night?

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.710
One second, Hayato-kun!

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:57.140
What exactly did Ysley-kun say to you?
How are you hitting so much harder already?

00:09:57.140 --> 00:10:01.190
Something about consciously trying
to get lighter, the way Paula does.

00:10:01.190 --> 00:10:05.080
Upping my weight when I land a blow
is supposed to make a difference, too.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.930
Oh, I see...

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:08.920
Lowering your weight for speed

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:12.500
and then increasing it for power
is fundamental stuff!

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:15.380
And you never realized it for yourself?

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:21.550
Ysley-kun! Already done
negotiating with the humans?

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:23.610
Yup. No problems on our end.

00:10:23.610 --> 00:10:26.790
Thanks to the lack of delays,
we won't need the whole week.

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:31.560
That's perfect. I don't think we'll
be needing it, either.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:36.750
Hayato-kun, practice is over for now.
Next is live combat.

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:40.920
We're going to invade the Zoble Empire today.

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:50.710
Four new targets have appeared!

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:57.260
M-M-Master... I-It's been so long...

00:10:57.260 --> 00:11:00.010
Prontea! It really has been a while.

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:04.450
Th-That's... another Idaten
we've never seen before!

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:06.940
Is he the one who defeated
Piscalat and the others?

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:10.020
If he's too strong for us to handle,

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:11.810
we'll have to flee, won't we?

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:16.080
Um, Prontea-san, you're looking a bit shaky...

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:19.490
Were you able to shut down the audio
and video transmissions from the ships?

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:22.070
Uh... Sorry. N-No can do.

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:26.660
Then I suppose it's only a matter of
time before this "Miku" figures out

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:28.450
that we're preparing to invade.

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:31.640
Hey, Miku! A new Idaten has appeared!

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:33.910
I want you to analyze him ASAP!

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.220
Hmm? Miku?

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:40.010
What? The reports?

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:44.050
Those can wait! I want you
to start looking into this new one—

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:49.140
His Majesty is here, too?!

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:51.600
Wh-Who are you supposed to be?

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:54.510
M-Mistress Miku told me

00:11:54.510 --> 00:11:56.660
to sit there and be quiet.

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:59.740
And if I'm found out, to hand over this letter.

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:01.940
Dear Demon Lord...

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:03.840
Looks like you caught me!

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:06.300
Sorry, but after assessing
the current situation,

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:08.360
I've decided we're totally screwed!

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:12.250
That being the case, I'm going to flee
the country! Hope you understand!

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:14.510
I'm also taking Umeyo with me

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:17.900
in the event that we get a chance
to rebuild the demon race later on!

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:20.330
A word of warning:

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:24.000
If the three Idaten on our radar
rendezvous with the powerful one,

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:28.450
or if you confirm the
presence of a new Idaten,

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:29.970
I'm fairly sure what comes next will be...

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:32.100
an immediate invasion.

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:35.990
The three of them are on the move!

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:37.400
Th-They're so fast!

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:39.900
What's with these tunnels?

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:42.150
I'd say Kroft was the one who dug them.

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:44.020
Raki most likely put him up to it.

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:46.470
Brandy takes her responsibilities
pretty seriously,

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:48.400
so I doubt she'd run in the face of danger,

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:50.660
but I bet she told her
children to make a break for it.

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.140
I'm curious, Umeyo.

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:56.120
How many children are in the process
of fusing inside you right now?

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:58.920
Two of them. Both boys.

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:04.720
That means once they're old enough,
Merku and I can start popping out babies!

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:06.300
Wait... Me, too?!

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:09.820
You want me to have kids with someone
who's just a baby right now?

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:11.770
How perverted are you?!

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:13.460
Don't worry so much!

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:17.290
I'll make sure they know all the ins and outs
by the time they're ready for action!

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:19.230
That's not what I'm objecting to!

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:22.890
I personally like the idea
of taking some naive boy

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:25.150
and getting him addicted to my body.

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:27.360
Are shotas not your thing?

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:30.580
I mean, I like them, but...

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:35.030
I never would've guessed
that was your style!

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:41.120
Chat time is over! It's time to beat it!

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.660
The letter I left has been opened!

00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:45.990
Something must've happened with the Idaten,

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:49.760
which means it won't be
long before they attack!

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:54.600
Brandy! Miku's flown the coop!

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:59.140
Why would she go on her own?
We could've all fled as a group.

00:13:59.140 --> 00:14:00.470
It's obvious enough.

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:03.320
She meant to make herself scarce
while the rest of us are being killed.

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:08.780
I'm sure she judged that to be
her best hope of escape.

00:14:09.650 --> 00:14:12.130
Emergency notice! Emergency notice!

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:16.440
All roads leading in and out
of Zoble are being destroyed!

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:25.510
M... M-M-Miku!

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:27.750
The path behind us just got demolished!

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:31.010
Looks like they're eliminating
all methods of egress.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:34.500
By cutting away at the land,
they can turn Zoble into a giant island

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:38.020
and then take their time wiping
out all of the demons inside.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:42.440
That means, at present, any demon
on the other side of the divide...

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.010
has nowhere to run.

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:47.530
Not having to work
with Master is pretty relaxing...

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:52.320
Your Lordship, I also told my
own children to flee beforehand.

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:56.110
If the Idaten realize that the
majority of demons are here,

00:14:56.110 --> 00:14:57.880
they'll focus their attention on us.

00:14:57.880 --> 00:15:00.230
That will allow my children
and Miku's group to escape.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:02.580
Come along, darling.

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:07.210
You were bored of playing emperor
for so long anyway, weren't you?

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:10.720
Let's raise some hell,
like we did when we were young.

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:15.220
Fair enough. Let's do it.

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:20.820
There it is, Granny. That's the Zoble Empire.

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:24.900
I see. And that's where the demons are?

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:34.700
But how will they attack? How will they
tell us apart from the humans?

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:45.040
Damn it, Granny, there's only like
300 demons in the whole country.

00:15:45.660 --> 00:15:47.050
Is that right?

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:50.640
They're insane...
Not a thought in their heads...

00:15:50.640 --> 00:15:55.120
They're attacking with no concern
for human lives, not to mention efficacy.

00:15:55.510 --> 00:15:58.310
It's idiotic. One of them is a big old dummy.

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:00.270
But that works out perfectly...

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:03.520
Do you hear me, citizens of Zoble?

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:08.300
Do you hear me, all soldiers?
This is General Piscalat of the Imperial Army.

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:11.840
I realize this is sudden, but the time
has come for a military coup d'état.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.530
P-Piscalat?!

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:16.290
Any civilians and people who
feel like surviving will need

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:18.030
to follow my orders and evacuate.

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:21.540
Your only chance of survival is to head
for the northern coast immediately.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:25.290
There will be no flights out.
Air travel will make you a priority target.

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:28.480
Damn it, General Piscalat!
What are you doing?!

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:31.050
Time to hunt a traitor!

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:32.880
I'm gonna get a crack at General Piscalat—

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:38.710
Now, to those of you
who failed to flee, prepare to die.

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:39.350
Over and out.

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:41.810
They're taking advantage of Piscalat's voice!

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:43.890
What's going on?!

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:46.800
Please, God, save us!

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:49.450
Come on, you old bag! Quit making a mess!

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:52.190
How are we supposed to keep track like this?

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:53.570
This is such a nuisance!

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:57.830
Prontea says he can tell
the demons from the humans.

00:16:57.830 --> 00:17:00.310
Leave the judgment calls to him.

00:17:00.310 --> 00:17:04.090
We're only going after the ones
who're obviously not human.

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:09.380
Demon Teen    Salamanda

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:10.550
There you are, Idaten!

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:12.430
I'm the best demon there is
when it comes to digging!

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:14.520
And now Salamanda is gonna dig your....

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:16.450
grave?!

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:22.390
We just gotta kill 300 of those, right?

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:25.270
I see. This may be easier than I thought.

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:29.340
Now, how will this shake out?

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:31.510
Why am I here with you guys?

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:35.820
Because if any additional demons show up,
we won't be able to handle them.

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:38.760
We don't amount to much in a fight, huh?

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:45.970
This is absolute madness!

00:17:45.970 --> 00:17:49.480
And I swear, as the fastest demon alive,
I'm gonna get as far away—

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:56.080
That makes ten, I think.

00:17:57.470 --> 00:18:00.760
The evacuation seems
to be going smoothly, but...

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:04.510
I still don't see any priority targets.

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:08.650
If you want to protect the humans
so that they can rebuild later,

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:11.670
you'll want Prime Minister Biarov.
He's human, but talented.

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:13.230
I'm sure he'll be useful.

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:17.570
It'd be ideal to make allies
of Miku and Barcode, as well.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:19.600
What they look like?

00:18:20.150 --> 00:18:23.230
Well, they operate behind the scenes,
so there are no pictures...

00:18:23.230 --> 00:18:24.950
Wait, you want us to draw them?

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:31.300
I think Cory's is probably the closest.

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:33.210
It'll have to do, then...

00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:38.340
Is this gonna work?

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:40.660
You're not going any farther!

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:43.830
We're gonna show you the
power of the Super Beefy Bros.!

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:49.640
Oh? Hayato's grown a lot stronger.

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:53.030
This is gonna take all damn day.

00:18:53.030 --> 00:18:55.480
Let's split up, Granny.

00:18:56.670 --> 00:18:59.490
He's still not quite as
reliable as Prontea, but...

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:06.080
I'm pretty sure I pierced that one's heart.

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.640
Did I miss?

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:17.450
What's with them?
They're suddenly moving much sharper.

00:19:17.450 --> 00:19:18.270
In that case...

00:19:22.030 --> 00:19:24.720
Can't move with their heads gone.

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:30.850
They're still not dead,
even after losing their heads?!

00:19:33.000 --> 00:19:35.610
Wh-What is this?

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:37.090
She's so solid!

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:40.170
I won't be able to keep her away
with ultra-thin hair alone....

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:41.610
Still, I must remain calm.

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:44.760
She's not the kind of enemy
I can beat head-on.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:49.260
The important thing is that she
assumes she's fighting weaklings.

00:19:49.260 --> 00:19:51.850
I need her to believe that.

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:55.960
The hell is that?

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:57.580
One of General Piscalat's men?

00:19:57.580 --> 00:19:59.850
Keep firing! Shoot him down!

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:09.140
You're a demon, aren't you?

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:12.140
Hey, get your ass back here!

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:13.420
I can't take it anymore!

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:14.970
Let us out of here!

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:17.450
Everyone, you mustn't lose hope!

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:20.990
I'm sure God will show us mercy!

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:28.370
Hey, over there!

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:31.420
Man, he managed to get pretty far...

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:34.890
Huh, why didn't those humans run?

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:37.950
Wh-Who are you?

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:42.550
No, it doesn't matter right now.
Please, help us!

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:44.870
Open these cells!

00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:47.240
Please! Help!

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:49.430
Cells? Huh, so this is how
you keep humans in place...

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:59.160
Well, you're free, but you might
be safer staying in here for now.

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:02.670
Though it all depends on how
wild the crazy old bitch gets...

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:04.810
J-Just who are you...?

00:21:04.810 --> 00:21:06.520
He's a god.

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:13.410
Albeit not the kind of all-powerful
creator deity that you worship.

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:16.170
E-Emperor Takeshita?!

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:18.510
You all have won this war.

00:21:18.510 --> 00:21:23.870
But for the sake of the future...
I need to at least manage to kill you.
